Package: agents-usage
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Agents Usage maintainers <local@agents-usage.invalid>
Depends: libc6, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6
Description: Lightweight coding-agent account usage tray utility
 Agents Usage is a compact GNOME/KDE tray utility for viewing usage across
 supported coding-agent accounts through their installed CLIs and quota services.
